    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, you learn to manifest raw flames of fel. You gain a new attack option that you can use with the Attack action. This special attack is a ranged weapon attack with a range of 30 feet. You are proficient with it and add your Dexterity modifier to its attack and damage rolls. On a successful hit, this special attack deals 1d6 fire damage.</p><p>When you gain the Extra Attack feature, this special attack can be used for any of the attacks you make as part of the Attack action.</p><p>At 11th level, the damage of your Chaos Flames increase to 1d10 fire damage.</p>",
